{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted","id":1352314,"title":"How would you alter sorcerous workings and sorcery for modern exalted?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-03T01:47:09-08:00","id":1352314,"title":"How would you alter sorcerous workings and sorcery for modern exalted?","content":"Let's say you write up modern exalted. Do you increase and alter anything? If you've got access to a phone, things like Infallible messenger aren't nearly as impressive. If you've got a car or access to a plane, Stormwind Rider and Azure Chariot is not all that special. If you've got, well... <br /> <br /> Basically, I think it would be nice to have a rewrite. Any ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T02:58:57-08:00","id":1352318,"title":"","content":"Change some spells so they fit in better(the things you mentioned maybe, then again, the government can't log your flying cloud...probably), add some spells for specifically modern things, and change the examples given for Sorcoerous Workings, but not the actual hard effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8fsIR2T.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13566-kalzky","name":"Kalzky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13566_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T03:10:46-08:00","id":1352320,"title":"","content":"If I drive a car, I have to own or rent or steal one, have a license to drive one, and even then it only takes me to places that good roads have been constructed to lead it there, and even then only if I have money to buy sufficient gas to get me there. I have to obey numerous regulations along the way, about how fast I can go and what lanes I can drive in and where I can turn.<br /> <br /> And for every regulation that exists on the ground, there's even more for air travel; at least when you hop in a car, you don't have to log a plan with the government before you can start the ignition. At least some asshole with a wand won't make you take off your shoes before you can set foot in the garage. At least no one gives you hassle about the size of your shampoo bottle. And you won't get teeth knocked out because you wouldn't give up your car seat for a later departure because you have to go perform surgery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T03:24:40-08:00","id":1352323,"title":"","content":"Exalted is a magical setting where magic is rife.<br /> <br /> Modern settings have no magic, or hidden magic. The Chrestomanci books are a great illustration of this.<br /> <br /> Ergo, in a modern setting I'd bump everything two Ambitions higher -- Terrestrial 1 becomes Terrestrial 3, Celesital 2 becomes Solar 1, Solar 1 becomes the new peak of sorcery at Solar 3 difficulty.<br /> <br /> Exalted is a world with various schools to teach people magic, a massive Guild providing mystic reagents (like Frozen Lightning), and gods and demons who walk amongst men sharing mystic knowledge. Sorcery is the invention of the Primordials and burned into the fabric of Creation by Salina. Sorcery is going to be much, much harder without these things.<br /> <br /> The banality of mobile phones and cars is the death knell of magic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T03:34:37-08:00","id":1352325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352323#post1352323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted is a magical setting where magic is rife.<br /> <br /> Modern settings have no magic, or hidden magic. The Chrestomanci books are a great illustration of this.<br /> <br /> Ergo, in a modern setting I'd bump everything two Ambitions higher -- Terrestrial 1 becomes Terrestrial 3, Celesital 2 becomes Solar 1, Solar 1 becomes the new peak of sorcery at Solar 3 difficulty.<br /> <br /> Exalted is a world with various schools to teach people magic, a massive Guild providing mystic reagents (like Frozen Lightning), and gods and demons who walk amongst men sharing mystic knowledge. Sorcery is the invention of the Primordials and burned into the fabric of Creation by Salina. Sorcery is going to be much, much harder without these things.<br /> <br /> The banality of mobile phones and cars is the death knell of magic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why?<br /> <br /> Jkwjwne","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T04:05:45-08:00","id":1352328,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I think you're fundamentally missing the point of Exalted Modern there.<br /> <br /> It's <i>Exalted</i> Modern. The fantasy crap stays.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T04:27:22-08:00","id":1352333,"title":"","content":"Is anyone else not seeing <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12952\" data-vbnamecard=\"12952\">Accelerator</a> 's posts?<br /> <br /> \u200bI didn't add him to my Ignore list...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T04:34:49-08:00","id":1352334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352333#post1352333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is anyone else not seeing <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12952\" data-vbnamecard=\"12952\">Accelerator</a> 's posts?<br /> <br /> \u200bI didn't add him to my Ignore list...</div> </div> </div> </div>Same here. I tried adding him to Ignore and removing him and I still can't see anything he posted.<br /> Edit: But now I can. Strange.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted#post1352314\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's say you write up modern exalted. Do you increase and alter anything? If you've got access to a phone, things like Infallible messenger aren't nearly as impressive. If you've got a car or access to a plane, Stormwind Rider and Azure Chariot is not all that special. If you've got, well...<br /> <br /> Basically, I think it would be nice to have a rewrite. Any ideas?</div> </div> </div> </div>Infallible Messenger is untraceable, unspoofable, untappable, doesn't need a battery, doesn't need a network connection. Mutter to yourself in the bathroom and you've contacted Big Bob the Crime Lord without anyone else knowing. That's amazing, especially if it's not a common-knowledge spell. <br /> Stormwind Rider might not be as fast as a jet, but it still beats the heck out of freeway driving, it can land and take off literally anywhere, doesn't need any form of license or training, and is way way cheaper than flying your own vehicle. It's also <i>awesome</i>, which is important. <br /> <br /> Don't focus on &quot;X does thing, tech does thing, therefore X is bad now.&quot;. Focus on &quot;X does thing, tech does thing, but X does thing differently. How can I make that difference be beneficial?&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25764,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25764-vwllss-trnt-prncss","user":"vwllss trnt prncss","date":". 12-03-2019, 07:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25764-vwllss-trnt-prncss","name":"vwllss trnt prncss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"244"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T04:37:45-08:00","id":1352335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vwllss trnt prncss</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352334#post1352334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Same here. I tried adding him to Ignore and removing him and I can't see anything he posted.<br /> Edit: But now I can. Strange.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can see him, now, too. Guess it was just a weird hiccup.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T04:55:40-08:00","id":1352340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352335#post1352335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can see him, now, too. Guess it was just a weird hiccup.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wish someone fixed up this forum. Sometimes my posts get eaten","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-03T06:27:43-08:00","id":1352348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352328#post1352328\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I think you're fundamentally missing the point of Exalted Modern there.<br /> <br /> It's <i>Exalted</i> Modern. The fantasy crap stays.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fantasy crap staying is fine. I see no reason why an Exalted Modern setting would make any fantasy crap <i>increased</i>.<br /> <br /> If you can shoot lightning from your fingertips, that lightning doesn't get stronger if the people around you upgrade from bows to guns, then get weaker if they swap their guns for slingshots.<br /> <br /> I guess it depends on the conciet of your setting.<br /> <br /> If your Exalted Modern is Creation ten thousand years after the Empress disappeared then that's a different setting to Exalted in oWoD, or Burn Legend, or Exalted appearing in the Real World ushering in a world of magic which never existed before. <br /> <br /> <br /> Burn Legend is a great example of the kind of muted magic I'm talking about. I agree that would be totally inappropriate for a Creation that's advanced to modern day (magi-)tech, but if your setting was (for example) a world where magic doesn't exist, then <i><b>suddenly <u>Solars!!!</u></b></i>... that's inherently a lot less magical than Creation. No gods. No Heptagram. No frozen lightning. No Salinian working. No Book of Three Circles. Everything your new Solars are doing is being done for the first time in a sterile world. Even if magic isn't harder and weaker, there's absolutely no way it should be <i>easier or more powerful</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T12:36:40-08:00","id":1352661,"title":"","content":"See, for modern Exalted, my big question is this: where are the Charms for Abilities like Drive and Computer? You know, the Abilities that simply don't exist in the Exalted framework because it explicitly is not designed to take them into account.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;At the risk of sounding like a murder hobo&quot;<br /> <br /> Attributed to Nyrufa.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24134-inertial-frame","name":"Inertial Frame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T12:55:53-08:00","id":1352666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352323#post1352323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted is a magical setting where magic is rife.<br /> <br /> Modern settings have no magic, or hidden magic.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're EXCEPTIONALLY boring, maybe. If I'm playing an Exalted Modern I'd prefer a Modern game where magic isn't hidden just because. I've had too much of it, because it's oversaturated, to the point where you yourself seem to assume that that's just a given, that Modern games would have less or no magic at all.<br /> <br /> As for the OP's question... I wouldn't change much at all, aside from maybe refluff some of the spells appearance-wise. Sorcery is still Sorcery with its traditions and Initiations. Remember that an advantage of Sorcery Spells is that while someone can swipe your cell phone, nobody can swipe a spell from your brain (unless there's a future Sidereal Charm that lets them steal your thoughts). It's EXALTED, I didn't pick up a game about playing a super-powered divinely-empowered champion to do no half-assed underdog Urban Fantasy Masquerade bullshit. I signed up to play goddamn EXALTED.<br /> <br /> (And that right there also ties into why I think Exalted vs WoD is a dumb premise, because there's only one logical way it can shake out, and that is that the Exalts completely wreck the shit of the WoD power blocks in like a month and then you migrate into Exalted Modern, because the Vampires are all dead)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T14:41:48-08:00","id":1352677,"title":"","content":"As I understand it, the thing with the Workings system is that it's meant to be fairly narrative and contextual and doesn't care too much about the form of things.<br /> <br /> So it strives to avoid things like &quot;Actually I just make this totally un-magical vehicle much more efficient than completely magically constructed vehicle, at a lower Working level&quot;, because that's potentially making things with different aesthetics having different Working costs. (Many examples much described in lots of &quot;modern magic&quot; stuff, and I expect M:tA folk are old hands at these).<br /> <br /> If that's correct (and not a misreading!) then it does imply that there *may* make sense to preserve the spirit of the system by reducing the difficulty of some types of Workings?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T17:06:29-08:00","id":1352703,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Inertial Frame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352661#post1352661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See, for modern Exalted, my big question is this: where are the Charms for Abilities like Drive and Computer? You know, the Abilities that simply don't exist in the Exalted framework because it explicitly is not designed to take them into account.</div> </div> </div> </div>Shard of an Exalted Dream has charms for Drive, Firearms, and Lore (for computers).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352666#post1352666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(And that right there also ties into why I think Exalted vs WoD is a dumb premise, because there's only one logical way it can shake out, and that is that the Exalts completely wreck the shit of the WoD power blocks in like a month and then you migrate into Exalted Modern, because the Vampires are all dead)</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the premises of Holder's Exalted Versus World of Darkness is that the Essence available in the World of Darkness is &quot;the cold ashes of a long-dead flame burying a few, a very few, smoldering embers.&quot; So regaining essences is MUCH slower. This greatly limits Exalts - they are still powerful for WoD, but it's not going to be a blatent stomp.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24362,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24362-fredo","user":"Fredo","date":". 12-04-2019, 08:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24362-fredo","name":"Fredo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-05T00:55:29-08:00","id":1352770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fredo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352314-how-would-you-alter-sorcerous-workings-and-sorcery-for-modern-exalted?p=1352703#post1352703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the premises of Holder's Exalted Versus World of Darkness is that the Essence available in the World of Darkness is &quot;the cold ashes of a long-dead flame burying a few, a very few, smoldering embers.&quot; So regaining essences is MUCH slower. This greatly limits Exalts - they are still powerful for WoD, but it's not going to be a blatent stomp.</div> </div> </div> </div>I admit that 80% of the reason why I think Exalted vs WoD is a dumb premise is because I don't like anything about WoD and would very much prefer to keep it as far away from Exalted as possible. Tying Exalted to the prehistory of WoD was a dumb idea quickly dropped early on in 1e and they should keep the games as far apart as possible.<br /> <br /> I haven't looked at Holden's little crossover writeup and I don't plan to, because it's not a concept I have any interest in.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-05T02:36:57-08:00","id":1352778,"title":"","content":"One thing you could do with Modern sorcery is come up with new sorcerous initiations. Ones that only work in such a setting.<br /> <br /> Like maybe a sorcerer can draw power from electronic devices, or you have a Talisman of Ten Thousand Eyes but it's a smartphone. You could take some cues from (sorry Kyman) Mage the Ascension and all their different paradigms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}